INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(245,12,14025156,12,'AVL','2025-26','2025-12-06','Arsenal','H','PL',90,7.6,1,'RDM','RDM',5,'4-2-3-1',50.5,36.3,47.3,76,'0,2,4,1,4,0,0,3,4,9,1,4,4,9,5,1,6,4,4,3,0,0,2,2,4','024140034X144X61744300224',NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,4,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"interceptions": 1, "tackles": 4, "duels_won": 5}','(match heatmap analysis)','Team-high 76 tracked points and 60 touches with excellent 42/46 passing. Avg position X=50, Y=36 — the true anchor: deepest of the outfield midfielders, sat slightly right of centre in front of the back line (roughly ahead of Konsa). Hottest zone: central-to-right defensive third and halfway line. Movement: the low-mobility screen — held position to shield the space Zubimendi/Ødegaard/Rice attacked, tidied second balls, and recycled possession to beat the press. 4 tackles won + 1 interception; the least vertical of Villa''s midfield trio, providing the base that let Tielemans push up and the fullbacks fly forward.','SofaScore API /event/14025156/average-positions (2026-07-02)','HIGH on avg coords (API). Minutes/rating not captured in this sweep; pos_class derived from coords alone. Collected to settle the pivot-side question; no appearances after 2026-01-10 (injury).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
