INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(568,2,14025257,30,'AVL','2025-26','2025-10-26','Manchester City','H','PL',90,8.4,1,'RB','RB',1,'4-2-3-1',39.5,15.0,47.1,85,'2,0,1,0,1,0,0,1,1,15,0,0,0,3,15,0,0,0,2,20,0,0,1,8,15','1010100118000280001X00148',0.06,0.07,1,4,4,2,1,1,0,76,NULL,'{"xg": 0.06, "xa": 0.07, "key_passes": 1, "passes_total": 48, "passes_acc": 39, "touches": 76, "duels_won": 4, "duels_lost": 4, "tackles": 2, "interceptions": 1, "shots_on": 1, "goals": 1, "assists": 0}','Starting right-back in a 4-2-3-1; disciplined, defensively-anchored full-back tasked with containing City''s left-side overloads, staying compact rather than over-committing forward, but joining a set-piece routine to score. Not captain, played full 90.','Right defensive-to-middle third channel (mid|right-flank 42%, def|right-flank 38% of activity) / Average position deep-ish on the right, avg pitch coords approx (x=39, y=15) on SofaScore''s 0-100 scale — defensive-leaning for a full-back. Movement split 40% defensive third / 42% middle third / 18% attacking third; 85% of touches hugged the right touchline (y<25). Touch spread reached x=1 to x=99, i.e. he did get all the way forward once (the 19th-minute goal off Buendia''s short-corner routine, curling a low left-footed shot into the bottom corner) but his baseline was a contained, recovery-focused right-back display. 76 touches, 39/48 passing, 2 tackles, 4 clearances, 1 interception, 1 key pass, 1 big chance created, 4 duels won. Named Player of the Match.','SofaScore API /event/14025257/lineups players[] 배열순서 + /average-positions (2026-07-31)','HIGH on minutes/rating/avg coords (API). lineup_order는 라인업 배열 인덱스 = 원천값이고 좌표 역산이 아니다. lineup_pos는 (formation, order) 파생 — 실측 y 레인과 대조 검증됨. pos_class는 minutes<45일 때 NULL(좌표 평균 신뢰불가).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
